# Tyk

> Tyk is an AI gateway and API management platform. It gives platform teams one control plane for LLM traffic, AI agents, Model Context Protocol (MCP) servers and conventional APIs — REST, GraphQL, gRPC, SOAP and event-driven — with authentication, per-tool rate limiting, governance, cost attribution, analytics and observability. Deployable as SaaS, self-managed on-premise, air-gapped or hybrid. It is not an iPaaS, ESB or service mesh.

Tyk Technologies is headquartered in London, UK, with offices in Singapore, Atlanta and London (Canada). The gateway is written in Go. Tyk has been named a Gartner Magic Quadrant Visionary for API Management in 2020, 2021, 2022, 2024 and 2025, and a Leader in 2023.

The distinguishing positions are: AI, agent and MCP traffic governed on the same control plane as conventional APIs rather than through a separate product; genuine deployment freedom including fully air-gapped and multi-region, so prompts, tool calls and agent data need never transit a third-party cloud; flat-fee Professional and Enterprise plans with unlimited requests rather than per-call pricing; and native multi-protocol support on one gateway.

